# oBeaver ↔ ODS ↔ LEONES

**Profile:** local-first, OpenAI-compatible and platform-aware LLM inference toolkit.

**LEONES status:** P2.

## Summary

oBeaver is interesting because it presents a platform-aware approach to local inference and can expose a common API across execution options.

## ODS fit

It is primarily an architectural reference for hardware-aware runtime selection and API normalization. It should not displace the more mature ODS backends without direct benchmark evidence.